WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:05.900
Kanemayu akufotokoza mawonekedwe abwinobwino komanso achilendo a fundal red reflex.

2
00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:19.370
Kuyeza kwabwino kwa fundal red reflex ndi pamene palibe kusiyana pakati pa kuwala ndi mtundu pakati pa maso awiri omwe ali ndi mawonekedwe apakati pa cornea.

3
00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:31.530
Ngakhale maonekedwe abwino a fundal reflex, komabe, amasiyana malinga ndi momwe muliri komanso kumene mwanayo akuyang'ana.

4
00:00:31.910 --> 00:00:42.010
Ndiko kuyezetsa kochititsa chidwi komwe muyenera kusuntha cham'mbali ndikubwerera m'mbuyo ndi mozungulira kutalika kwa mkono kuchokera kwa wodwala.

5
00:00:42.010 --> 00:00:51.350
Makanda ndi ana amasunthanso manja ndi maso awo, zomwe zimapangitsa kuti reflex asinthe momwe amawonekera panthawi yowunika.

6
00:00:51.910 --> 00:01:02.350
Mwa mwana wakuda, reflex imawoneka yotumbululuka, yachikasu ndi yoyera ndipo nthawi zina ngakhale yabuluu ngati mtundu waukulu.

7
00:01:02.350 --> 00:01:14.970
Chofunika kwambiri, pakuwunika koyenera, pasakhale kusiyana kwakukulu pakuwala ndi mtundu pakati pa maso awiri omwe ali ndi mawonekedwe apakati a cornea.

8
00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:23.850
Kuwoneka kwachilendo ndi pamene pali kusiyana kosalekeza, kwenikweni pakuwala ndi mtundu pakati pa maso awiriwo.

9
00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:35.840
Kuwonekera kwa cornea, chigamba chakuda chomwe chili mkati mwa diso limodzi kapena diso lonse, kapena reflex yofiyira kulibe.

10
00:01:37.670 --> 00:01:56.330
Kuyeza kwachilendo kwa reflex kungasonyeze kukhalapo kwa ng'ala, retinoblastoma, cornea scar, squint, refractive error kapena mavuto obadwa nawo monga coloboma.

11
00:01:56.970 --> 00:02:01.690
Zonsezi zimafuna kuunika kwinanso ndi katswiri.

12
00:02:02.650 --> 00:02:10.900
Yang'anani malingaliro awa ndikudzifunsa nokha: kodi izi ndizabwinobwino kapena sizachilendo? Mayankho adzatsatira pambuyo pake.

13
00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:45.840
Tsopano muyenera kumvetsetsa bwino momwe chiwombankhanga chowoneka bwino chimawonekera, komanso kusakhazikika bwino, ndikutha kunena chomwe chingakhale choyambitsa.
